{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Runemaster Frost Spectre: Smolder and Primordial Blast crit harder against frozen targets (#1153)",
  "contract": [
    "Frost Spectre 560039 (rank 1) and 561350 (rank 2), CharacterAdvancement 6473, Spell.dbc SpellFamilyName 38, read",
    "'Increases the critical strike chance and critical damage of Smolder and Primordial Blast against Frozen targets",
    "by $s1%.' Both records carry two SPELL_AURA_OVERRIDE_CLASS_SCRIPTS (112) effects on the caster, EffectBasePoints",
    "24 / 49 with DieSides 1 (25% / 50%), EffectMiscValueB 4 (AURA_STATE_FROZEN) and class mask (0x200, 0, 0x40):",
    "effect 0 MiscValue 20000 (masked critical strike chance), effect 1 MiscValue 20001 (masked critical damage).",
    "Mask word 0 0x200 is every Smolder rank (502623-502633, 801087; DmgClass melee, Fire) and word 2 0x40 is every",
    "Primordial Blast rank (502823-502827, 800732; DmgClass magic). The raw 20000-series selectors are not enabled",
    "(SpellAuraDefines.h), so Unit::GetAscensionConditionalCombatModifier ignored them and the talent did nothing.",
    "Expected against a target frozen by Frost Nova 122: Unit::SpellTakenCritChance rises by exactly 25 (rank 1)",
    "or 50 (rank 2) points for both spells, and Unit::SpellCriticalDamageBonus on a 1000 base rises by 25% / 50% of",
    "the critical total (2000 for the melee-class Smolder, 1500 for the magic Primordial Blast). Against the unfrozen",
    "target nothing changes; the untalented Runemaster is unaffected; Hurricane's strike 645437 (outside the mask)",
    "is unaffected."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
  "players": [
